# Design system

- Edit colors only via `:root` tokens in `src/styles/global.css`. Do not put ad-hoc hex in `.astro` pages.
- Prefer existing BEM classes in `global.css`; do not invent a parallel style system.
- Theme changes must update: tokens, matching hardcodes, and favicon colors to match the palette.

## Current palette (refined dark — charcoal + cyan)

| Token | Value |
|---|---|
| `--color-bg` | `#111318` |
| `--color-surface` | `#181b22` |
| `--color-surface-2` | `#22262f` |
| `--color-border` | `#2a2f3a` |
| `--color-border-soft` | `#1f232c` |
| `--color-text` | `#F1F5F9` |
| `--color-text-muted` | `#94A3B8` |
| `--color-text-subtle` | `#64748B` |
| `--color-accent` | `#22D3EE` |
| `--color-accent-soft` | `#083344` |

`color-scheme: dark`.

## Hardcode exceptions (must match bg / accent)

- `.site-header` backdrop: `rgb(17 19 24 / 0.85)` (equals `--color-bg`)
- `.btn--primary` / `.nav-cta`: dark text `#0F172A` on cyan (bright accent needs dark ink)
- `.btn--primary:hover`: `#67E8F9` with `#0F172A` text
- `--shadow-card`: dark UI shadows (`rgb(0 0 0 / 0.35)` / `0.3`)
